  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Bengaluru: Magnet Hospitals has launched the ‘Golden Hour Recognition’ campaign ahead of Emergency Nurses Day in Bengaluru.The campaign highlights the life-saving importance of the first 60 minutes after a medical emergency and seeks to recognise the contribution of emergency nurses during this critical period.According to Magnet Hospitals, emergency nurses are often the first clinical point of contact for patients, and the quality of their initial assessment and response can shape the course of subsequent care.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>“Their work often goes unseen: triaging, stabilising and communicating with anxious families, all under pressure,” the hospital said.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Dinesh Madhavan, Managing Director, Magnet Hospitals, said, “By telling the story of the first hour through the voices of those who live it, Magnet Hospitals aims to build public awareness of the value of timely emergency care and reinforce its commitment to a model in which nurses are leaders and stakeholders, not only caregivers.”</p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 14, 2026 at 01:17 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 14, 2026 at 01:17 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n      